<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 12-month T-bill yield rises to 21.86 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 12-month T-bill yield rises to 21.86 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's 12-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 21.86 percent, up from 21.41 percent at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    14,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     16,302.47 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   14,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		15,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    21.86 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     82.1826 pct</p>
</text>
